# =============================================================================
# komira_crypto/tests/test_bettertls_synthetic.mojo
# =============================================================================
#
# A generated test file: the certificates below are data. Do not edit a
# case's bytes by hand; replace the whole case.
#
# Synthetic BetterTLS-style adversarial PKI corpus driver. Iterates 19
# generated test cases covering RFC 5280 §6 path-validation behaviors +
# RFC 6125 hostname binding.
#
# The synthetic corpus is a stand-in for the Netflix BetterTLS Go-based
# test generator (which does not ship a static corpus to vendor); the
# adversarial categories mirror BetterTLS PathBuilding axes.
#
# Acceptance gate: >=80% of cases match expected outcome.
# =============================================================================

